FiniteFittingIdeals -- Computing Fitting ideals and Quot schemes of points
**************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package implements an algorithm for computing Fitting ideals of finite
modules from the paper Gotzmann's persistence theorem for finite modules
arXiv:1411.7940 (see http://arxiv.org/abs/1411.7940 ) by Gustav Sædén Ståhl.


The following is an example illustrating the main functions provided in the
package.
  * *note Fitting ideals of finite modules: Fitting ideals of finite modules,

Author
======

  * Gustav Sædén Ståhl (see http://www.math.kth.se/~gss ) <gss@math.kth.se>

