========

  * *note nextDegree: nextDegree, -- Lifts the kernel to the next degree
  * *note co1Fitting: co1Fitting, -- Calculates the (n-1)'th Fitting ideal of a
    finite module
  * *note affinePart: affinePart, -- Replaces columns in a matrix with an
    identity matrix

